From 74d0b0385b185679514cc327ec45be19c2c84401 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "Christopher A. Williamson" <contact@chrisaw.io>
Date: Mon, 28 Sep 2026 16:57:51 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 1/1] appsearch: neuter the isolated storage service

the isolated storage service runs appsearch icing inside an avf vm,
which the gsi does not ship. replace the manager with a shell that
keeps the surface the rest of appsearch compiles against but always
reports the feature unavailable, and drop the framework-virtualization
stub dependencies so the module builds without the virtualization
sources. the data migration helpers stay intact for the classic
migration paths.
